{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1089864-c20-treasures","id":1089864,"title":"c20 - Treasures","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Changeling: The Dreaming"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-05-08T11:14:48-07:00","id":1089864,"title":"c20 - Treasures","content":"Can some one please explain to me how treasures actually work in c20, i cant for the life of me wrap my head around it.. you dont need realms? so your pool is jsut the art? and you pump glamor to be stored into it? im not following it at all. any help would be appriciated.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5533-cameraobscura83","name":"CameraObscura83","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5533_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"151"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-08T12:14:50-07:00","id":1089879,"title":"","content":"The rules for Treasure use have always been flimsy. I've either ruled that you can make a Glamour roll to activate them or spend a Glamour point for an automatic success. But it's less than ideal for replicating Art uses.<br /> <br /> How about this system: roll Glamour + Treasure rating (difficulty of your own Banality). That way, mortals probably can't use them, and you're drawing on your own connection to the Dreaming to use it. That would make sense.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer, publisher, performer<br /> Mostly he/his, sometimes she/her IRL <a href=\"https://adam-lowe.com\" target=\"_blank\">https://adam-lowe.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5291-adambeyoncelowe","name":"adambeyoncelowe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5291_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2802"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-08T13:07:05-07:00","id":1089911,"title":"","content":"I don't dislike that, but i wanna understand the rules as written before i start house ruling things? thanks for the ideas though i have it filed away.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5533-cameraobscura83","name":"CameraObscura83","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5533_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"151"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-08T13:34:35-07:00","id":1089930,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CameraObscura83</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1089864-c20-treasures?p=1089911#post1089911\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I don't dislike that, but i wanna understand the rules as written before i start house ruling things? thanks for the ideas though i have it filed away.</div> </div> </div> </div>I see the problem. The RAW says this:<br /> <br /> 'Each use of a crafted Treasure\u2019s Art requires the roll associated with the Art\u2019s level, where applicable.'<br /> <br /> But then it says this:<br /> <br /> 'If the Treasure\u2019s effect is purely magical (a pearl that lets the changeling see anyone she concentrates on), the dice pool might be the character\u2019s Glamour rating or Intelligence + Gremayre.'<br /> <br /> I'd take your pick: Art rating only, Glamour rating only, or Intelligence + Gremayre (difficulty 6?). Maybe this needs to go in the errata thread?<br /> <br /> As for Glamour, it looks like you can imbue the Treasure with up to 10 points for future activations. If you destroy a Treasure, you can only reap dross equal to its rating, which implies Glamour imbued by the user can't be reabsorbed later except for the sole purpose of activating the Treasure.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer, publisher, performer<br /> Mostly he/his, sometimes she/her IRL <a href=\"https://adam-lowe.com\" target=\"_blank\">https://adam-lowe.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5291-adambeyoncelowe","name":"adambeyoncelowe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5291_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2802"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-08T14:13:46-07:00","id":1089948,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>adambeyoncelowe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1089864-c20-treasures?p=1089930#post1089930\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'd take your pick: Art rating only, Glamour rating only, or Intelligence + Gremayre (difficulty 6?). Maybe this needs to go in the errata thread?</div> </div> </div> </div>I think it is.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>...","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5211-firkraag","name":"Firkraag","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5211_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"381"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}